      "title": "Common signals for present perfect",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Several words often point to present perfect because they ask about experience, recent result, or a period that reaches up to now. They are signals, not automatic rules: always check whether the sentence also names a finished past time."
            }
          ]
        },
